  "golden_id": "tier2b/bakes/normal-hemisphere-per-vertex",
  "tier": "2b",
  "domain": "bake_map/normal",
  "description": "Tier 2b bake golden of phase3.2_baker-normal (decision 384) on the analytic fixture hemisphere: the normal-convention hemisphere: a coarse smooth unit hemisphere under its faceted copy scaled by 1.002 (parity/NORMAL-CONVENTION.md section 1). Painter bakes Normal at 512 px (OutputSize 9, DilationWidth 0, RelativeScale False, MaxHeight 0.02, MaxDepth 0.02; every other baking parameter at Painter's default; normal map format OpenGL, tangent space PerVertex). The baked maps are exported as PNG 16 and OpenEXR 32f, padding passthrough, no dithering; recorded twice (same session; after save and reopen). Bake backend uncontrolled.",
  "inputs": [
    {
      "input_id": "hemisphere-low",
      "kind": "mesh",
      "path": "parity/fixtures/normal-convention/hemisphere-low.obj",
      "sha256": "04aaca03526fe09efedf39fb2b7262ae88fe0497098dac219d3469052b52f7fc",
